Fashion photography but make it golf 💚📸 @NikonAustralia @Teds_Cameras

On Saturday, I had the joy of presenting a fashion photography masterclass to a wonderful group of photographers, from curious enthusiasts to seasoned pros. I shared my 6 biggest lessons in fashion photography: everything from mindset, the power of light to the importance of storytelling, before switching things up with a live golf editorial photoshoot.

The highlight for me was inviting the students to get hands-on. They really enjoyed stepping behind the lens and trying out their own ideas, which made the session feel collaborative and fun.

A big thank you to everyone who joined and supported this event. Excited to see where this mix of fashion and golf takes us next.

Mega thanks to my team for making this happen!
@jeshdeleon 
